This product includes 68 modules extracted from the a11oy and killinchu
application repositories (byte-identical at extraction time, verified with
`cmp`; see MIGRATION.md) to establish a single shared source of truth and
eliminate source duplication. Among them:

  - szl_calibration : ECE/Brier calibration tracking (pure-Python).
  - szl_dsse        : DSSE/ECDSA-P256-SHA256 signing (cosign-compatible), with
                      cryptographic primitives (canonical_json, pae) derived
                      from khipu-consensus.
  - szl_brain       : governed reasoning-brain scaffolding (Λ aggregator,
                      advisory — Conjecture 1).

src/szl_substrate/_vendor_blobs.py embeds third-party assets that are not
covered by the Apache-2.0 license of this product: 60 KaTeX font files and
the earth-night.jpg globe texture, byte-identical to files in the MIT-licensed
npm packages katex and three-globe, and Space Grotesk and JetBrains Mono font
files (SIL Open Font License 1.1). Their provenance, copyright notices and
license texts are in NOTICE-THIRD-PARTY.md.

Λ = Conjecture 1 (advisory, uniqueness open — NOT a proven theorem).
Signed receipts are real DSSE in a Space with a cosign key, and an explicit
UNSIGNED-honest marker otherwise. No signature is ever fabricated.

